  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1499",
    "issue_date": "2026-11-26T02:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-26T01:26:12.564Z",
    "meteorologist": "Hari Dahal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा कुनै पनि मौसमी प्रणालीको उल्लेखनीय प्रभाव रहेको छैन ।",
    "analysis_en": "Currently, no significant weather system is influencing Nepal.",
    "today_np": "कोशी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी क्षेत्र, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका पहाडी क्षेत्रमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ, बाँकी क्षेत्रमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ।",
    "today_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and Hilly regions of Koshi Province, and the Hilly regions of Gandaki, Lumbini, Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces, while the weather will remain mainly fair in the remaining areas.",
    "tomorrow_np": "कोशी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी क्षेत्रमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ, बाँकी क्षेत्रमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। बिहानपख उपत्यका र खोँचहरूका साथै तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा हुस्सु/कुहिरो लाग्नेछ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and Hilly regions of Koshi Province, while the weather will remain mainly fair in the remaining areas. Mist/fog is likely at some places in valleys and river basins, as well as in the Terai regions, during the early morning.",
    "special": ""
  },
